# The horizontal keys at a permission question (APPROVAL-HORIZONTAL-KEYS).
# fx v0.0.16 moves the choice on Left and Alt-b (previous) and Right and
# Alt-f (next) while no amendment is open, wrapping at both ends, and leaves
# it on every other spelling of the four: Ctrl- and Alt-Left and -Right,
# Shift-Left and -Right, Super-Left and -Right, Ctrl-B and Ctrl-F, Shift-Alt-f
# (input_approval_runtime.zig:90-128, approval_decision.zig:214-225@481104fd).
# In an amendment they are the draft's caret moves. A draft is painted only
# while it has the keys (approval_ui.zig:1181-1193): after Down the first
# choice reads `Apply once`, Tab shows its draft again, and Enter on the
# first choice sends it, shown or not (approval_decision.zig:112-127).
# The turns, the workspace and the settings are approvals.cap's.
fx: gateway approvals-fx.json
xfx: gateway approvals-xfx.json
work approvals-ws
fx: seed approvals-fx-settings.json
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
wait 3
type edit the files
key Enter
wait 3
snap ask
# The amendment: Alt-b, Shift-Left and Ctrl-B move its caret.
key Tab
wait 0.4
type ab cd
wait 0.4
key M-b
wait 0.4
type z
wait 0.4
snap amend-alt-b
key S-Left
key -H 02
wait 0.4
type y
wait 0.4
snap amend-keys
# Down ends the amendment and marks choice 2.
key Down
wait 0.4
snap down
key Left
wait 0.4
snap left
key Left
wait 0.4
snap left-wrap
key Right
wait 0.4
snap right-wrap
key Right
wait 0.4
snap right
key M-f
wait 0.4
snap alt-f
key M-b
wait 0.4
snap alt-b
# Alt-f in kitty's and xterm's spellings, Alt-b in both: 2 -> 3 -> 1 -> 3 -> 2.
key -H 1b 5b 31 30 32 3b 33 75
wait 0.4
snap kitty-alt-f
key -H 1b 5b 32 37 3b 33 3b 31 30 32 7e
wait 0.4
snap mok-alt-f
key -H 1b 5b 39 38 3b 33 75
wait 0.4
snap kitty-alt-b
key -H 1b 5b 32 37 3b 33 3b 39 38 7e
wait 0.4
snap mok-alt-b
# From choice 2, keys that leave it there.
key C-Right
wait 0.4
snap ctrl-right
key C-Left
wait 0.4
snap ctrl-left
key M-Right
wait 0.4
snap alt-right
key M-Left
wait 0.4
snap alt-left
key S-Right
wait 0.4
snap shift-right
key S-Left
wait 0.4
snap shift-left
key -H 06
wait 0.4
snap ctrl-f
key -H 02
wait 0.4
snap ctrl-b
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 43
wait 0.4
snap super-right
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 44
wait 0.4
snap super-left
key -H 1b 5b 31 30 32 3b 34 75
wait 0.4
snap shift-alt-f
# Back on choice 1 its draft is not painted; Tab paints it again.
key Left
wait 0.4
snap back
key Tab
wait 0.4
snap tab-back
# Leave it unpainted again, and Enter on choice 1 sends it.
key Down
key Up
wait 0.4
snap unpainted
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap answered
